M4.22 preflight report whitespace diagnosis
Date: 2026-08-28

Error image
-----------
The staged-diff whitespace check reported trailing spaces on the report's date
and environment lines.

Cause
-----
Those two Markdown lines used two trailing spaces as an explicit line break.
The repository's whitespace policy rejects that otherwise valid Markdown form.

Risk
----
None to runtime behavior, evidence values or the server. The issue was confined
to formatting in a new documentation file.

Rollback
--------
No server rollback is required. The formatting correction and this diagnosis
can be reverted with the M4.22 branch.

Approved continuation
---------------------
Replace the two trailing-space line breaks with blank lines, restage the exact
M4.22 allowlist and repeat the staged-diff and regression checks.
